<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Moderna completes Monsanto sale.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Moderna completes Monsanto sale.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empresas La Moderna announced Monday that its Seminis subsidiary has completed its previously-announced sale of Asgrow's Agronomic business to Monsanto Co for $240 million.</p>
<p>Moderna will retain the vegetable business division of Asgrow, which combined with Petoseed and Royal Sluis will continue to be known as Seminis Vegetable Seeds Inc, Moderna said in a statement from its headquarters here in northern Mexico.</p>
<p>((-- Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7287902))</p>
